inx 与 F5 披露 NGINX2Root 五个 RCE 漏洞，未认证攻击者可经 HTTP/2 触发内存破坏，并与 Linux 内核 SCTP 漏洞串联取得 root、逃逸 Docker 容器访问宿主机。","sourceName","CrowdStrike","sourceUrl","https://www.crowdstrike.com/en-us/blog/crowdstrike-helps-protect-against-nginx2root-cve-2026-123007/","publishedAt","2026-11-19T06:00:00.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/4bb18fbefa568e31.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/f338ab1b3d8b6c40.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/4bb18fbefa568e31.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"followUp","pi6rz141w402yirr3sp93bzlj","CodeWhale 0.8.67 及更早版本 exec_shell 自动批准机制可导致无提示 RCE","CodeWhale 0.8.67 及更早版本的 exec_shell 并行只读分类器会错误自动批准带执行能力的 fd、rg 和 git grep 参数，使默认交互式 Agent 模式可在无审批提示的情况下执行任意外部程序。","GitHub 安全公告","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-3mgh-93r5-r7jf","2026-11-19T22:48:14.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp","/dailyinfo/media/f426f4f60d806c23.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp 96w","mpx0uupjxhqqh2y5ws97b5m3u","k8s-mcp-server 默认 SSE/HTTP 传输缺失认证，未授权用户可执行 Kubernetes 工具","k8s-mcp-server 的默认 SSE 传输模式在 8080 端口绑定 0.0.0.0，MCP tools/call 端点未校验认证、会话令牌或 Origin，攻击者可枚举并调用 Kubernetes 工具。","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-m932-63jc-4jqq","2026-11-19T22:48:33.000Z","l9hohsjkbs1vdmrgj7b8hg1pm","European Commission 确认遭 AI 驱动网络攻击，多项应用被临时下线","European Commission 确认遭到使用公开 AI 工具实施的网络攻击，入侵于 2026 年 10 月 22 日被发现、10 月 26 日被定性为网络攻击，导致包括员工工资与考勤系统 Sysper、医疗报销系统在内的多项应用被临时下线，目前大部分已恢复。","Infosecurity Magazine","https://www.infosecurity-magazine.com/news/commission-ai-attack-systems/","2026-11-19T14:45:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp","/dailyinfo/media/6406d1b57afc7303.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp 96w","otherSources","iqdjh7ur9xudskpehj0nrufc5","攻击者滥用 CyberPower PowerPanel 在域控制器运行恶意脚本","攻击者滥用 CyberPower PowerPanel Business (PBB) 的断电脚本功能，通过 Web 控制台上传脚本并在 Windows 域控制器上以 SYSTEM 权限执行，随后投放反病毒杀手、复制存储网络账户凭据的 Active Directory 数据库，并借助 DLL sideloading 植入持久化组件。","https://www.infosecurity-magazine.com/news/ups-software-abused-domain/","2026-11-19T15:30:00.000Z","hvmdf2b2hvm47t3sscn2okaod","eml_parser v3.0.3 存在 Received 头解析 ReDoS 漏洞，复杂度达 O(n^4)","eml_parser v3.0.3 的 `Received` 头解析存在算法复杂度漏洞，攻击者可通过构造日期尾部包含不平衡 `(` 的标头触发四层贪婪正则回溯。","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-m4g8-47f9-h588","2026-11-19T22:47:08.000Z","oy8aa1yf0lb6hllwj6lpg2yh4","VMware vCenter 认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123890，CVSS 9.8","VMware vCenter 存在认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123890，CVSS 评分 9.8，具备网络访问权限的攻击者可绕过认证并获得未授权访问。","The Hacker News","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/critical-vmware-vcenter-flaw-cvss-98.html","2026-11-19T15:11:06.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","d4alkbrizhut2tkg9zf5yo7q6","containerd 镜像清单畸形摘要触发守护进程崩溃","containerd 镜像清单处理缺陷可导致守护进程发生不可恢复的 panic，使通过 transfer service 导入恶意图像或执行默认 CRI `PullImage` 请求的 containerd 崩溃。","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-vwhp-8p66-mq4f","2026-11-19T22:46:24.000Z","j4s27xftxuxxz61195rb78ckj","Apache Axis CVE-2026-90436 与 Apache Roller CVE-2026-129448 已遭在野利用","Apache Axis CVE-2026-90436 与 Apache Roller CVE-2026-129448 已被用于真实攻击，两者 CVSS 均为 9.8。","SecurityWeek","https://www.securityweek.com/critical-apache-roller-axis-vulnerabilities-exploited-in-attacks/","2026-11-19T12:13:24.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp","/dailyinfo/media/c2a91b85de7bb9d6.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp 96w","he0bob19pbje3opocivfw0w0a","Java4Shell 漏洞 CVE-2026-114938 已出现利用尝试，多家厂商确认产品受影响","攻击者已开始针对 Java4Shell 漏洞 CVE-2026-114938 开展扫描和利用尝试。该漏洞影响支持 AVX-512 VBMI 的 x86-64 OpenJDK 17.0.6 及更高版本，可导致内存破坏；Calif 称默认配置下可在 Jira、Confluence、Jenkins、Keycloak 等产品实现未认证 RCE，但各产品需要定制利用链。","https://www.securityweek.com/java4shell-exploitation-attempts-begin-as-vendors-rush-out-advisories/","2026-11-19T09:10:58.000Z","related",[242],{"_162":243,"_51":244,"_165":-5,"_167":217,"_169":245,"_171":246,"_173":220,"_175":221,"_177":178,"_179":180},"wfvwclz2yypcudxbab0s81bqj","PHP 修复 8 个关键漏洞，CVE-2026-115560 等可导致远程代码执行","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/php-fixes-7-critical-flaws-including.html","2026-11-19T15:18:07.000Z",{"_250":333,"_165":-5,"_252":334},{"_250":310,"_165":-5,"_252":311},{"_250":251,"_165":-5,"_252":253},"label","研究与披露","items",[254,255,256],{"_162":270,"_51":271,"_165":272,"_167":273,"_169":274,"_171":275,"_173":-5,"_177":180,"_179":180,"_203":54,"_240":276,"_181":104},{"_162":265,"_51":266,"_165":267,"_167":217,"_169":268,"_171":269,"_173":220,"_175":221,"_177":178,"_179":180},{"_162":257,"_51":258,"_165":259,"_167":260,"_169":261,"_171":262,"_173":263,"_175":264,"_177":180,"_179":180},"zivjvo29t1jew4ih1bkfouif8","Rapid7 分析 Webworm 定制的 SoftEther VPN 桥接工具 NtMonitor","Rapid7 分析了一个此前未公开的定制 SoftEther 桥接工具 NtMedium Monitor（NtMonitor），以中等置信度归因于中国相关的 APT 组织 Webworm。","Rapid7 CVE 公告","https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/tr-spying-on-governments-no-malware-custom-webworms-toolkit-softether-bridge","2026-11-19T15:05:34.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/092fbeae5b5c3123.webp","/dailyinfo/media/c16323cf53c574df.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/092fbeae5b5c3123.webp 96w","q423r7ae4bf730m7rys4si811","研究员披露 PostgreSQL、MySQL、Oracle 与 ClickHouse 数据库 RCE 利用链","Depthfirst 研究员 Zheng Yu 展示了 PostgreSQL、MySQL、ClickHouse 低权限数据库账户触发引擎内存缺陷的 PoC，以及 Oracle 无需登录的组合利用链。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/researcher-demonstrates-database-rce.html","2026-11-19T08:14:00.000Z","m51451stt7lkv5evn4mfrujes","NGINX HTTP/2 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-123007 已复现","微步在线已在实验环境中复现 NGINX HTTP/2 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-123007。该漏洞影响启用 HTTP/2 的未修复实例，攻击者无需认证或受害者配合即可远程执行代码并获得 NGINX 工作进程权限；在满足相关环境条件时，还可串联 Linux SCTP 内核漏洞实现宿主机 root 提权及容器逃逸。","微步在线研究响应中心","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5MTc3ODY4Mw==&mid=2247509063&idx=1&sn=45c71724375b83415bf880558c549bf0","2026-11-19T00:56:00.000Z",[277,278,279,280,281],{"_162":305,"_51":306,"_165":-5,"_167":307,"_169":308,"_171":309,"_173":-5,"_177":180,"_179":180},{"_162":300,"_51":301,"_165":-5,"_167":302,"_169":303,"_171":304,"_173":-5,"_177":180,"_179":180},{"_162":293,"_51":294,"_165":-5,"_167":295,"_169":296,"_171":297,"_173":298,"_175":299,"_177":178,"_179":180},{"_162":286,"_51":287,"_165":-5,"_167":288,"_169":289,"_171":290,"_173":291,"_175":292,"_177":178,"_179":180},{"_162":282,"_51":283,"_165":-5,"_167":230,"_169":284,"_171":285,"_173":233,"_175":234,"_177":178,"_179":180},"y2rg6xqvlodeoy597yrc3i73v","F5 修复五个 NGINX2Root 严重漏洞，公开 PoC 已出现","https://www.securityweek.com/f5-patches-critical-nginx2root-flaws-as-poc-exploits-go-public/","2026-11-19T10:26:51.000Z","u5of3sbmjv5zvaxsxp6jgty56","nginx2root 披露 5 个 nginx 严重漏洞及 Linux 内核提权链","Security Affairs","https://securityaffairs.com/203440/hacking/nginx2rootai-discovers-five-critical-nginx-flaws-and-a-path-to-root.html","2026-11-19T09:21:19.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp","/dailyinfo/media/2adef5b1e4357a03.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp 96w","mbxeacdusn1z4f6sixt69mp51","nginx 5 个远程代码执行漏洞披露，CVE-2026-123007 PoC 已公开","安全内参","https://www.secrss.com/articles/95792","2026-11-18T23:54:38.010Z","/dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3399ea7b18d18a6a.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp 96w","qfh0sjsz9ouip54rdzkoulw18","nginx 五个远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-123007 等已复现，官方发布 1.31.9 与 1.30.7 修复","长亭安全应急响应中心","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwMDk1MjMyMg==&mid=2247493555&idx=1&sn=d3242df2ead8cf888655e28825604924","2026-11-18T18:28:00.000Z","uhvazvdp48xo8g4vjsd383z43","nginx 多模块内存安全漏洞链式 RCE：五个 CVE 影响至 1.31.8","深信服千里目安全实验室","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2NjgzNjA5NQ==&mid=2247526508&idx=1&sn=31b47e13eeb1b8828d52cb90d456de24","2026-11-19T09:51:00.000Z","攻击与威胁",[312,313,314],{"_162":328,"_51":329,"_165":330,"_167":198,"_169":331,"_171":332,"_173":201,"_175":202,"_177":178,"_179":180},{"_162":320,"_51":321,"_165":322,"_167":323,"_169":324,"_171":325,"_173":326,"_175":327,"_177":178,"_179":180},{"_162":315,"_51":316,"_165":317,"_167":230,"_169":318,"_171":319,"_173":233,"_175":234,"_177":178,"_179":180},"u9nf8h7shihjjmr2eilozrfc0","Cisco Expressway 漏洞 CVE-2026-76466 已在野利用，F6 披露入侵过程","Cisco Expressway 漏洞 CVE-2026-76466（CVSS 9.8）已在 PoC 公开后被用于入侵一家俄罗斯机构，攻击者无需认证即可在集群设备上以 root 权限执行命令，受影响的是 Expressway Core 与 Edge 的虚拟和设备版本，仅集群部署存在风险。","https://www.securityweek.com/hackers-exploit-cisco-expressway-vulnerability-soon-after-poc-release/","2026-11-19T13:12:20.000Z","mxkst5z9aysxjtb8v981iupoo","SBC Medical Group 两起安全事件暴露 160 万客户及员工数据","SBC Medical Group 向美国证券交易委员会（SEC）披露，两起入侵暴露其日本业务中的客户、员工及预约诊疗信息。数据库事件涉及 1,624,000 人，泄露内容涵盖姓名、联系方式、出生日期、会员 ID、密码等，另有 255,416 条预约请求、217,769 条网站咨询和约 20,000 条员工账号记录；其中 459 名员工的银行账户及税务信息受影响。","BleepingComputer","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/hackers-steal-data-of-16-million-sbc-medical-group-customers/","2026-11-19T22:25:42.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","cc7qsurqjcbzxqury8oid8a18","Rakuten Securities 数据泄露或影响近 1600 万个账户","Rakuten Securities 表示，11 月 11 日测试环境中的部分信息被泄露至外部，4.47 million 个账户的资料被窃取，另有 11.25 million 个账户仅被窃取分支或客户代码及登录 ID，合计接近 16 million 人。","https://www.infosecurity-magazine.com/news/rakuten-securities-breach-15/","2026-11-19T09:20:00.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[335,336,337,338,339,340],{"_162":126,"_51":109,"_165":365,"_167":260,"_169":366,"_171":367,"_173":263,"_175":264,"_177":180,"_179":180,"_203":44},{"_162":360,"_51":361,"_165":362,"_167":230,"_169":363,"_171":364,"_173":233,"_175":234,"_177":178,"_179":180},{"_162":356,"_51":357,"_165":358,"_167":307,"_169":359,"_171":309,"_173":-5,"_177":180,"_179":180},{"_162":351,"_51":352,"_165":353,"_167":295,"_169":354,"_171":355,"_173":298,"_175":299,"_177":178,"_179":180},{"_162":346,"_51":347,"_165":348,"_167":185,"_169":349,"_171":350,"_173":188,"_175":189,"_177":180,"_179":180},{"_162":341,"_51":342,"_165":343,"_167":185,"_169":344,"_171":345,"_173":188,"_175":189,"_177":180,"_179":180},"vf1cup61nse9kclvd8mx15kfa","XWiki Platform HQL 注入漏洞可导致未认证提取数据库内容","XWiki Platform 的查询 REST API 存在 HQL 注入漏洞，未经认证的攻击者可通过 FROM 子句注入绕过 SELECT 列白名单，提取不可访问页面的数据、密码哈希及配置中的密码。","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-jmmc-wjpc-pg34","2026-11-19T20:44:32.000Z","v8bxu9wb0z1gw4jyowgo1l6ae","@openeudi/openid4vp 证书链校验漏洞可接受伪造证书，已在 0.8.1 修复","@openeudi/openid4vp 的 ChainBuilder 仅按 Subject DN 字符串相等终止证书链构建，未验证终止证书与信任锚的签名，攻击者可复制信任锚 Subject DN 并用私钥签发伪造凭证，使 OpenID4VP 验证路径将其误判为可信凭证。","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-4c2f-96cf-f5fc","2026-11-19T20:35:57.000Z","l4rwwnkcn10mehuvb5erq97bh","Vite 远程代码执行漏洞 QVD-2026-112681 已公开 PoC，官方发布补丁","奇安信CERT监测到并成功复现Vite远程代码执行漏洞QVD-2026-112681，CVSS 4.0评分为9.1，PoC、技术细节及EXP均已公开，但未发现在野利用。","https://www.secrss.com/articles/95805","2026-11-19T08:02:10.031Z","ij1t9r2o1yq64nrx86tf5fp89","Vite 开发服务器虚拟模块注入远程代码执行漏洞 SF_2026_47139 修复公告","Vite 开发服务器虚拟模块标识符处理存在注入缺陷，攻击者可在无需认证和用户交互的条件下远程执行代码并读取任意文件。","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2NjgzNjA5NQ==&mid=2247526508&idx=2&sn=ca0a32750a69f45993adc16941608714","cxsrv3tj2ve440bw0s2r18iyx","PHP 修复 7 个严重级 RCE 漏洞，发布 PHP 8.6.0 与 8.5.13","PHP 发布安全更新，修复 7 个严重级远程代码执行（RCE）漏洞，包括会话上传进度反序列化、多个 use-after-free、PHP-FPM 请求走私和时区缓存释放后使用问题。","https://www.securityweek.com/php-patches-seven-critical-rce-vulnerabilities/","2026-11-19T15:54:20.000Z","VMware vCenter 的认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123890 已被中国关联威胁组织 ARMORY CASTLE 在野利用，最早可追溯至 2026 年 9 月。","https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-123890-critical-authentication-bypass-vmware-vcenter","2026-11-19T21:06:24.000Z",{"_162":270,"_51":271,"_165":272,"_167":273,"_169":274,"_171":275,"_173":-5,"_177":180,"_179":180,"_203":54,"_240":371,"_181":104},{"_162":360,"_51":361,"_165":362,"_167":230,"_169":363,"_171":364,"_173":233,"_175":234,"_177":178,"_179":180},{"_162":328,"_51":329,"_165":330,"_167":198,"_169":331,"_171":332,"_173":201,"_175":202,"_177":178,"_179":180},[372,373,374,375,376],{"_162":305,"_51":306,"_165":-5,"_167":307,"_169":308,"_171":309,"_173":-5,"_177":180,"_179":180},{"_162":300,"_51":301,"_165":-5,"_167":302,"_169":303,"_171":304,"_173":-5,"_177":180,"_179":180},{"_162":293,"_51":294,"_165":-5,"_167":295,"_169":296,"_171":297,"_173":298,"_175":299,"_177":178,"_179":180},{"_162":286,"_51":287,"_165":-5,"_167":288,"_169":289,"_171":290,"_173":291,"_175":292,"_177":178,"_179":180},{"_162":282,"_51":283,"_165":-5,"_167":230,"_169":284,"_171":285,"_173":233,"_175":234,"_177":178,"_179":180},"leadParagraph",{"_379":380,"_381":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
